{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116012","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116012/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116012/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116012/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116012","id":3910699034,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7CMlPs","number":116012,"title":"Fix erroneous use of atomic in the dirty flags of Node3D","user":{"login":"HEX-23","id":29618465,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NjE4NDY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29618465?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HEX-23","html_url":"https://github.com/HEX-23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HEX-23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HEX-23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HEX-23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HEX-23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HEX-23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HEX-23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HEX-23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HEX-23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HEX-23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-02-07T16:46:14Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T21:24:06Z","closed_at":"2026-02-09T21:20:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116012","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116012","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116012.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116012.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-09T21:20:32Z"},"body":"Addresses [issue#116011](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116011), and potentially some other issues. The MRP of that issue should now have correct behavior when the commit of this PR is applied.\r\n\r\nBehavior of the MRP of [issue#116011](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116011), with this PR:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/117079db-07c0-4b7c-8353-501c859d4048\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\n\r\nNode3D simultaneously stores a `Transform3D` and a pair of euler angles and scale for some reason (documented in `node_3d.h`, right above definition of `enum TransformDirty`). Both representations are readable and writable.\r\n\r\nIt uses a dirty-flagging system to transparently handle this: when transform is set, euler angle and scale is flagged as dirty; when euler angle or scale is set, transform is flagged as dirty. As an optimization, actual update of the data is deferred until they are read.\r\n\r\nIn multi-threading mode (i.e., when thread group is set to sub), this dirty flag is implemented as a bitset based on atomic uint32 (`SafeNumeric<uint32_t>`, which is a wrapper over `std::atomic<uint32_t>`).\r\n\r\nThe problem is, when testing for certain bits in the atomic, what Node3D did is `flags.bit_and(mask)`. However, `SafeNumeric<>::bit_and` is implemented as `std::atomic<>::fetch_and`, whose semantic is \"atomically set the atomic variable `v` to `v & mask`, and return the original value of `v`\".\r\n\r\nThis would result in the following problem: any bit set in the dirty flag would cause a query with any mask to return true. And if the query is using a mask that *should* return false, the dirty flag will be effectively cleared.\r\n\r\nThe correct semantic should be \"load the value of `v` and return `v & mask`, without modifying `v`\". So it should be implemented as `flags.load() & mask`, instead.\r\n\r\nThis PR did exactly this.\r\n\r\n- Bugsquad: Fixes #116012","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116012/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116012/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}